      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Three Gates on a Resource\nA run can use a service connection, a variable\ngroup or an environment only after three gates\n([resource permissions](https://learn.microsof\nt.com/en-us/azure/devops/pipelines/security/re\nsources)):\n\n1. User roles decide who may see, use or\nadminister the resource.\n2. Pipeline permissions decide which pipelines\nmay use it. A run of an unauthorized pipeline\nstops with \"This pipeline needs permission to\naccess a resource before this run can\ncontinue\" ([service connections](https://learn\n.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/devops/pipelines/li\nbrary/service-endpoints)).\n3. Checks, such as an approval or a branch\ncontrol, run each time a stage uses the\nresource.\n\nIn Terraform,\n`azuredevops_pipeline_authorization` grants\nthe second gate. Without `pipeline_id`, it\nauthorizes every pipeline of the project\n([authorization doc](https://github.com/micros\noft/terraform-provider-azuredevops/blob/v1.16.\n0/website/docs/r/pipeline_authorization.html.m\narkdown#L111)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-f84d79cdc868",
      "originalText": "Three Gates on a Resource\nA run can use a service connection, a variable group or an environment only after three gates ([resource permissions](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/devops/pipelines/security/resources)):\n\n1. User roles decide who may see, use or administer the resource.\n2. Pipeline permissions decide which pipelines may use it. A run of an unauthorized pipeline stops with \"This pipeline needs permission to access a resource before this run can continue\" ([service connections](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/devops/pipelines/library/service-endpoints)).\n3. Checks, such as an approval or a branch control, run each time a stage uses the resource.\n\nIn Terraform, `azuredevops_pipeline_authorization` grants the second gate. Without `pipeline_id`, it authorizes every pipeline of the project ([authorization doc](https://github.com/microsoft/terraform-provider-azuredevops/blob/v1.16.0/website/docs/r/pipeline_authorization.html.markdown#L111)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "three-gates-on-a-resource"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6494033473,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-23758bfb109d",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
