      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Triggers Come from Two Places\nFor a repository in Azure Repos, a continuous\nintegration (CI) trigger comes from the\n`trigger` section of the YAML file. A pull\nrequest trigger does not come from YAML: a\nbranch policy on the target branch starts the\nrun ([PR triggers](https://learn.microsoft.com\n/en-us/azure/devops/pipelines/repos/azure-repo\ns-git)). So the `paths` in the YAML decide\nwhen a merge starts a run, while the path\nfilter of the branch policy decides when a\npull request starts one. The two lists must\nmatch by hand.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-0b705e95f761",
      "originalText": "Triggers Come from Two Places\nFor a repository in Azure Repos, a continuous integration (CI) trigger comes from the `trigger` section of the YAML file. A pull request trigger does not come from YAML: a branch policy on the target branch starts the run ([PR triggers](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/devops/pipelines/repos/azure-repos-git)). So the `paths` in the YAML decide when a merge starts a run, while the path filter of the branch policy decides when a pull request starts one. The two lists must match by hand.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "triggers-come-from-two-places"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7160772514,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-5c8ecc0ddb03",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1276.8,
      "y": 1160.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "#F8FAFC",
      "width": 418.8,
      "height": 220.0,
      "seed": 535609,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3,
        "value": 8
      },
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "text-5c8ecc0ddb03"
        },
