    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8189495257,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-93c37c334180",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1288.8,
      "y": 1420.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 297.5,
      "seed": 240437,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Task Shapes the Run\nA pipeline can run Terraform through a task,\nsuch as the community task TerraformCLI. The\ntask turns a service connection into\nenvironment variables and command-line\noptions. TerraformCLI, for example, exports\nonly the access key, the secret key and the\nregion of an AWS connection ([task code](https\n://github.com/jason-johnson/azure-pipelines-ta\nsks-terraform/blob/1.2.2/tasks/terraform-cli/s\nrc/providers/aws.ts#L23-L27)). It also adds\n`-auto-approve` to every `apply` ([task code](\nhttps://github.com/jason-johnson/azure-pipelin\nes-tasks-terraform/blob/1.2.2/tasks/terraform-\ncli/src/commands/tf-apply.ts#L20)). So read\nthe task's source or docs to learn what a run\nreally does.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-93c37c334180",
      "originalText": "The Task Shapes the Run\nA pipeline can run Terraform through a task, such as the community task TerraformCLI. The task turns a service connection into environment variables and command-line options. TerraformCLI, for example, exports only the access key, the secret key and the region of an AWS connection ([task code](https://github.com/jason-johnson/azure-pipelines-tasks-terraform/blob/1.2.2/tasks/terraform-cli/src/providers/aws.ts#L23-L27)). It also adds `-auto-approve` to every `apply` ([task code](https://github.com/jason-johnson/azure-pipelines-tasks-terraform/blob/1.2.2/tasks/terraform-cli/src/commands/tf-apply.ts#L20)). So read the task's source or docs to learn what a run really does.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "the-task-shapes-the-run"
      }
    },
