      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Masking Is Best Effort\nAzure Pipelines replaces each secret value\nwith `***` in the logs. It does not mask parts\nof a secret: \"We never mask substrings of\nsecrets\" ([set secret variables](https://learn\n.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/devops/pipelines/pr\nocess/set-secret-variables)). A secret that a\nscript splits, encodes or prints line by line\ncan therefore appear in clear text. Microsoft\nadvises against structured data, such as JSON,\nas a secret value.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-9f44c29f4148",
      "originalText": "Masking Is Best Effort\nAzure Pipelines replaces each secret value with `***` in the logs. It does not mask parts of a secret: \"We never mask substrings of secrets\" ([set secret variables](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/devops/pipelines/process/set-secret-variables)). A secret that a script splits, encodes or prints line by line can therefore appear in clear text. Microsoft advises against structured data, such as JSON, as a secret value.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "masking-is-best-effort"
      }
    },
