    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7789649563,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-508d918ca5b3",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1890.4,
      "y": 3697.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 227.5,
      "seed": 378700,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "New Connections Are Not Authorized\nA service connection that Terraform creates,\nor replaces, has no pipeline permission. The\nnext run of each pipeline that uses it stops\nand waits for permission ([issue 1008](https:/\n/github.com/microsoft/terraform-provider-azure\ndevops/issues/1008)). Add an\n`azuredevops_pipeline_authorization` for each\npipeline in the same configuration. Find the\npipeline ID with the data source\n`azuredevops_build_definition`, instead of\nwriting the number by hand; a recreated\npipeline gets a new ID.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-508d918ca5b3",
      "originalText": "New Connections Are Not Authorized\nA service connection that Terraform creates, or replaces, has no pipeline permission. The next run of each pipeline that uses it stops and waits for permission ([issue 1008](https://github.com/microsoft/terraform-provider-azuredevops/issues/1008)). Add an `azuredevops_pipeline_authorization` for each pipeline in the same configuration. Find the pipeline ID with the data source `azuredevops_build_definition`, instead of writing the number by hand; a recreated pipeline gets a new ID.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "new-connections-not-authorized"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1379038425,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-ec13f18134d3",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
