      "height": 210.0,
      "seed": 205111,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Token Lifetimes\nA PAT expires, and on organizations that use\nMicrosoft Entra ID it becomes inactive after\n90 days without use ([personal access tokens](\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/devops\n/organizations/accounts/use-personal-access-to\nkens-to-authenticate)). Microsoft is also\nretiring global PATs. The same page names\n2027-01-27 in one place and 2026-12-01 in\nanother as the end date. A configuration whose\nprovider uses a PAT stops working when the\ntoken does.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-71c0d3b03ac9",
      "originalText": "Token Lifetimes\nA PAT expires, and on organizations that use Microsoft Entra ID it becomes inactive after 90 days without use ([personal access tokens](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/devops/organizations/accounts/use-personal-access-tokens-to-authenticate)). Microsoft is also retiring global PATs. The same page names 2027-01-27 in one place and 2026-12-01 in another as the end date. A configuration whose provider uses a PAT stops working when the token does.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "token-lifetimes"
      }
    },
