      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Apply the Saved Plan\nPlan once, publish the plan file with the\nworking directory, review it, and apply that\nfile. HashiCorp recommends this for automation\n([running Terraform in automation](https://dev\neloper.hashicorp.com/terraform/tutorials/autom\nation/automate-terraform)). Treat the plan\nfile as a secret, because it holds the\nvariable values and parts of the state.\nRe-planning in the apply job is simpler, but\nwhat it applies was never reviewed.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-5285b2a7870b",
      "originalText": "Apply the Saved Plan\nPlan once, publish the plan file with the working directory, review it, and apply that file. HashiCorp recommends this for automation ([running Terraform in automation](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/tutorials/automation/automate-terraform)). Treat the plan file as a secret, because it holds the variable values and parts of the state. Re-planning in the apply job is simpler, but what it applies was never reviewed.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "apply-the-saved-plan"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2891599332,
