    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4846588013,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-dbe9f33faed7",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 5199.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 210.0,
      "seed": 865947,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One Identity per Environment\nMicrosoft recommends a branch control check on\neach service connection, and workload identity\nfederation instead of stored secrets\n([security overview](https://learn.microsoft.c\nom/en-us/azure/devops/pipelines/security/overv\niew)). A separate connection for each\nenvironment, with production restricted to the\nmain branch, keeps a pull request build away\nfrom production credentials. A plan on a pull\nrequest needs only read access; only the apply\nneeds write access.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-dbe9f33faed7",
      "originalText": "One Identity per Environment\nMicrosoft recommends a branch control check on each service connection, and workload identity federation instead of stored secrets ([security overview](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/devops/pipelines/security/overview)). A separate connection for each environment, with production restricted to the main branch, keeps a pull request build away from production credentials. A plan on a pull request needs only read access; only the apply needs write access.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "one-identity-per-environment"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9819812392,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-c04f1cf96e0a",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
